sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 User
    participant Frontend as 📱 Augmented Canvas<br/>(React/Vite)
    participant Backend as 🧠 Pilot Backend<br/>(Cloud Run)
    participant Auth as 🛡️ Auth/Security<br/>(Vertex/Model Armor)
    participant Alora as 🤖 Alora Agent<br/>(Orchestrator)

    User->>Frontend: Uploads Image / Asks Question
    activate Frontend
    Frontend->>Frontend: Compresses Image (Blob)
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /analyze {text, image}
    activate Backend
    
    Backend->>Auth: Validate Credentials (Vertex AI)
    Auth-->>Backend: OK
    
    Backend->>Alora: Invoke OrchestratorAgent
    activate Alora
    
    Alora->>Auth: Security Check (Model Armor)
    
    alt Unsafe Content
        Auth-->>Alora: BLOCK (Refusal)
        Alora-->>Backend: Return Refusal JSON
        Backend-->>Frontend: 400 Bad Request
        Frontend-->>User: Show Error
    else Safe Content
        Auth-->>Alora: APPROVED
        
        Alora->>Alora: Analyze Image (Vision)
        Alora->>Alora: Delegate to Intelligence Center
        
        note right of Alora: Detailed Agent & Tool<br/>Execution happens here<br/>(See Diagram 6)
        
        Alora-->>Backend: Stream Events (Logs)
        Backend-->>Frontend: SSE/WebSocket Logs
        
        Alora-->>Backend: Final JSON Result
        deactivate Alora
        
        Backend-->>Frontend: Return JSON {segments, facts}
    end
    
    deactivate Backend
    
    Frontend->>Frontend: Parse JSON & Render Widgets
    Frontend-->>User: Display Augmented Overlay
    deactivate Frontend
